  m_Name: Lore3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: Lore_3
  title: The Cards
  fullText: 'I almost forgot them.

    The cards.

    Strange how the mind lets
    go of what matters most.


    I have carried them before. Though I cannot remember
    when.

    Yet each time my hand reaches for one...

    Something stirs.

    A
    memory.


    They are more than gifts.

    More than power.

    They remember.


    Even
    when you cannot.


    Focus on the cards and...

    Try to Remember.'
